{
  "title": "Velero",
  "uid": "EbXSjT24k",
  "tags": [
    "Velero",
    "Panfactum"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What to do when a box is red",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Green means fine. Red means someone should act. \"No data\" means the metrics exporter is down, so the other boxes cannot be trusted.**\n\n| Box | If red |\n|---|---|\n| Backups that failed | A backup failed or partly failed. Run `velero backup describe <name> --details` on it. |\n| Time since last good backup | No backup fully succeeded in 2h. Run `velero backup get -n velero`, then `velero backup describe <newest> --details` and read Errors. If the list is empty, check the `velero` pod. |\n| Snapshots left after backup expired | The nightly cleanup missed these. Each one keeps a paid EBS snapshot. Check \"Time since cleanup succeeded\". |\n| Snapshot copies with no owner | Retained EBS snapshots whose backup expired. The nightly cleanup does not remove these. Patch each to `deletionPolicy: Delete`, then delete it. See `forks/kube_velero/README.md`. |\n| Time since cleanup succeeded | The `velero-snapshot-gc` job has not succeeded in 26h. Read its logs in the `velero` namespace. |\n| Out-of-memory crashes | The velero pod ran out of memory in the last 24h. Raise `velero_minimum_memory_mb`. |\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Backups that failed",
      "description": "Velero backups kept right now whose phase contains Failed, including partial failures. Red at 1 or more.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "None"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "noValue": "No data",
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (backup_name) (kube_customresource_velero_backup_info{phase=~\".*Failed.*\"})) or (vector(0) and on() (sum(up{job=\"velero-snapshot-metrics\"}) > 0))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Time since last good backup",
      "description": "Backups run every hour. Red after 2 hours. Red 'None since restart' means no backup succeeded since the velero pod last started.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 7200
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 900000000.0,
                "to": 1000000000000.0,
                "result": {
                  "text": "None since restart",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "noValue": "No data",
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(time() - max(velero_backup_last_successful_timestamp{schedule!=\"\"})) or vector(1e9)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Out-of-memory crashes (24h)",
      "description": "Velero containers that restarted after running out of memory in the last 24 hours.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "None"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "noValue": "No data",
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count((increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"velero\"}[24h]) > 0) and on(pod, container) kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"velero\",reason=\"OOMKilled\"}) or (vector(0) and on() (sum(up{job=\"kube-state-metrics\"}) > 0))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
